{
    "title": "Project: Muse",
    "description": "\"Project: Muse\" is an independent electronic music mobile game, created for you by professional music producers. After years of careful polishing, we will bring you the ultimate audio-visual experience. Invite your friends who love music to play together.\r\n\r\n[Fingertip click pronunciation]\r\nBreaking the traditional music game, every note will be activated in real time. When your finger presses down, the wonderful melody will be returned immediately. The original music full of dynamics and jumps allows you to feel the real-time performance brought by your fingertips.\r\n\r\n[Rich Featured Tracks]\r\nWhen the radio sounds, you will no longer be alone. More than 40 characters with different personalities, more than 100 electronic songs with various styles, and we are still updating. You will have more rhythm challenges.\r\n\r\n[Cool theme skin]\r\nWell-designed personalized skin, more impactful visual effects. You can freely choose the skin matching, reject the same monotonous skin.\r\n\r\n[Selected song package plot]\r\nA selection of packs with a variety of different themes, combining the fetters between characters. You can gain a deeper understanding of their story backgrounds, walk into the inner world of the characters, and have more emotional experiences.\r\n\r\n[Character Personality Space]\r\nSpace exploration, tracking the hidden stories of Muse. Each character has their own unique space, and you can let the elves go out to explore and retrieve objects for their space. The character space will continue to be updated and opened.\r\n\r\n[Super God Contest Ranking]\r\nHand speed flow? Invite your friends to a real electronic music competition!\r\n\r\nGame rules\uff1a\r\n\u2022 Tap the note while following the rhyme, ensure to get perfect.\r\n\u2022 Don't miss a note, hit combos and hit perfectly to get high scores.\r\n\r\nBest experience with headphones.\r\n\r\nThis Game Obvious Improvement On Amblyopia!\r\nInstructions on the use of amblyopia / hyperopia training:\r\n1. First, you need to choose special skin for [amblyopia / hyperopia] in the game (those with normal vision are not recommended) \r\n2. The principle of hyperopia is to increase vision by using the sensitivity of awakening visual cells such as red light, blue light, lattice light and afterimage light to stimulate eyeball development and enhance vision.\r\n\r\nHope you to enjoy the game!\r\nThanks to the game icon p. Muse-- Emily made by the player \"SmolAntBoi\".\r\nThanks to ColBreakz, Blaver, KODOMOi, Akako Hinami, Yan Dongwei, Sheng YunZe and other famous music producers.\r\n\r\nFacebook:https://www.facebook.com/RinzzGame\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n\u201cProject: Muse\u201d is a free game\uff0cbut it involves optional VIP paid service and some game props need to be paid for.\r\n\r\nTips: \r\nIf you encounter problems in the game, please contact the customer service email: work@rinzz.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Project: Muse&quot; is an independent electronic music mobile game, created for you by professional music producers. After years of careful polishing, we will bring you the ultimate audio-visual experience. Invite your friends who love music to play together.<br><br>[Fingertip click pronunciation]<br>Breaking the traditional music game, every note will be activated in real time. When your finger presses down, the wonderful melody will be returned immediately. The original music full of dynamics and jumps allows you to feel the real-time performance brought by your fingertips.<br><br>[Rich Featured Tracks]<br>When the radio sounds, you will no longer be alone. More than 40 characters with different personalities, more than 100 electronic songs with various styles, and we are still updating. You will have more rhythm challenges.<br><br>[Cool theme skin]<br>Well-designed personalized skin, more impactful visual effects. You can freely choose the skin matching, reject the same monotonous skin.<br><br>[Selected song package plot]<br>A selection of packs with a variety of different themes, combining the fetters between characters. You can gain a deeper understanding of their story backgrounds, walk into the inner world of the characters, and have more emotional experiences.<br><br>[Character Personality Space]<br>Space exploration, tracking the hidden stories of Muse. Each character has their own unique space, and you can let the elves go out to explore and retrieve objects for their space. The character space will continue to be updated and opened.<br><br>[Super God Contest Ranking]<br>Hand speed flow? Invite your friends to a real electronic music competition!<br><br>Game rules\uff1a<br>\u2022 Tap the note while following the rhyme, ensure to get perfect.<br>\u2022 Don&#39;t miss a note, hit combos and hit perfectly to get high scores.<br><br>Best experience with headphones.<br><br>This Game Obvious Improvement On Amblyopia!<br>Instructions on the use of amblyopia / hyperopia training:<br>1. First, you need to choose special skin for [amblyopia / hyperopia] in the game (those with normal vision are not recommended) <br>2. The principle of hyperopia is to increase vision by using the sensitivity of awakening visual cells such as red light, blue light, lattice light and afterimage light to stimulate eyeball development and enhance vision.<br><br>Hope you to enjoy the game!<br>Thanks to the game icon p. Muse-- Emily made by the player &quot;SmolAntBoi&quot;.<br>Thanks to ColBreakz, Blaver, KODOMOi, Akako Hinami, Yan Dongwei, Sheng YunZe and other famous music producers.<br><br>Facebook:https://www.facebook.com/RinzzGame<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>\u201cProject: Muse\u201d is a free game\uff0cbut it involves optional VIP paid service and some game props need to be paid for.<br><br>Tips: <br>If you encounter problems in the game, please contact the customer service email: work@rinzz.com.",
